 "Mother: Hari ini kita membuat panekuk. Rani: Apa yang kulakukan lebih dulu? Mother: Campur telur dan tepung. Tuang susunya. Rani: Baik. Mother: Sekarang nyalakan kompornya. Masukkan sedikit mentega. Rani: Aku menuang adonannya. Mother: Setelah satu menit, balik panekuknya. Angkat dan makanlah!",
 ("What does Mother ask Rani to do after one minute?", "Turn the pancake over", "Mix the eggs", "Turn off the stove", "Pour the milk in", "Mother: \"After one minute, turn the pancake over.\""),
 ("Take out it of the pan.", "Turn on the stove.", "Turn the pancake over.", "Pour the milk in.", "Kata ganti (it) harus di tengah: take it out."),
 ('Choose the correct word: "Turn the pancake ___."', "over", "on", "off", "up", "Turn over = membalik."),
